<title>NETHERLANDS: HEIDEMIJ UNIT WINS TUNISIAN ORDER.</title>
<headline>HEIDEMIJ UNIT WINS TUNISIAN ORDER.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch engineering consultancy Heidemij NV said its Grabowsky &amp; Poort unit had won a $10 million order as part of a $120 million stadium construction project in Tunisia.</p>
<p>Heidemij said Grabowsky &amp; Poort would be responsible for design and engineering of the stadium as well as for overall integrated project management.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
